# Testing And CI Rules

- Treat `mvn -B -ntp test` as minimum gate for non-trivial changes.
- Keep CI build and local verification commands aligned.
- Update runbooks when CI behavior or command sequences change.
- Prefer deterministic scripts in `scripts/` for agent-driven validation.

# Pull Request Hygiene

- Document what was run and what remains unverified.
- Keep pipeline changes minimal and explain rationale in PR notes.
